Step 1 — Extract into a temporary review folder
From your project root, run:
mkdir -p /tmp/cpc_catalogue_review

unzip -o versions/cpc_catalogue_phase1_bundle.zip \
  -d /tmp/cpc_catalogue_review


This will not change your application files.
Step 2 — Check the database changes
Run:
diff -u storage/database.py \
  /tmp/cpc_catalogue_review/cpc_catalogue_phase1/storage/database.py


Then inspect the importer:
sed -n '1,240p' \
  /tmp/cpc_catalogue_review/cpc_catalogue_phase1/scripts/import_cpc_definitions.py


And inspect its README:
cat /tmp/cpc_catalogue_review/cpc_catalogue_phase1/README.md


Please share the output, particularly any errors. The database diff may be lengthy; that's fine.